  "releaseNotes": "Adds a database-managed SMTP engine with multiple named profiles, enabled by the host with builder.AddSmtp(). Modules send email in process through ISmtpService or ISmtpProfileService, and clients use the same actions over HTTP. A database script must be installed before the engine is enabled.\n\nFull release note: https://github.com/MatrixCode-ID/em-system/blob/v0.1.0-alpha.8/doc/ReleaseNote/EmSys.Api.Core/0.1.0-alpha.8.md",
